{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The World Tree is dying, which threatens Seed's world, a cute little seed chosen by the village chief to take over! Traverse various perilous environments in this 3D platformer to save its village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/ImageDescription1v2.png?t=1742047729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your village is in danger, and you must save it! Traverse 7 environments, each different from the others, to reach your ultimate goal: the World Tree and save your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/ARenvironmentGIFv2.gif?t=1742047729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A grueling adventure awaits! Overcome a variety of obstacles adapted to the environment that will put you to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/ARlevelGIFv2.gif?t=1742047729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your difficulty level from Easy, Normal, and for the bravest, Hard mode!<br><br>Accessible to small configurations and limited storage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/ImageDescription2v2.png?t=1742047729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401530?t=1742047729","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742047729","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/848b63b7b7c8e7e72d37e5fabb6d6b4cf0e65d6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742047729","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/848b63b7b7c8e7e72d37e5fabb6d6b4cf0e65d6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742047729","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The World Tree is dying, which threatens Seed's world, a cute little seed chosen by the village chief to take over! Traverse various perilous environments in this 3D platformer to save its village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/ImageDescription1v2.png?t=1742047729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your village is in danger, and you must save it! Traverse 7 environments, each different from the others, to reach your ultimate goal: the World Tree and save your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/ARenvironmentGIFv2.gif?t=1742047729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A grueling adventure awaits! Overcome a variety of obstacles adapted to the environment that will put you to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/ARlevelGIFv2.gif?t=1742047729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your difficulty level from Easy, Normal, and for the bravest, Hard mode!<br><br>Accessible to small configurations and limited storage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/ImageDescription2v2.png?t=1742047729\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ebuyubi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse